{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9df140c7ae535768672651e5f01424f1989552548a808963a2bfc9a8e8091349",
      "text": "海外短篇动画日语配音的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6810326f8396c89325804d1f331dbeb2af84cbe697722d423a2c1e1f92e22b1e",
      "text": "“在我不在的时候，\n居然发生了那么严重的事情啊……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f4636a086d35188f88ee4d603eebce7809109ba2ffdbb2834ac1ac954e911fb",
      "text": "“不过，已经没事了！\n我不会再让那些家伙为所欲为了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f30602d95b87948db1915257db473298df4e09855a1adffbe2ea4407b820dd",
      "text": "“大家就由我们来守护，\n你就好好休息吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000034:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1e6ca6e509b5e28bb184f7fdc3bec40366fad775daae81eb4bdf00a7cbf73ba",
      "text": "旬先生，辛苦了。\n角色的神采活灵活现，非常棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36c435ba422113828a68fbd583e53bbe9fae2c87ba7eccace85f13fc8b2d9a73",
      "text": "导演也夸奖说找旬先生来配音真是太对了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30352d15dbf67d696b3df834c0e0ec02fda3724cab9147acf0c62af99d7685a2",
      "text": "真的吗？太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339cb936c45f1f0b71e2e36d536d2242f327c8756a37967b882379bd54d5b430",
      "text": "虽然接到工作邀请后也去上了配音课，\n但确实相当不容易，吃了不少苦头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4e109cedf0f2be04e1ffc69bf77aff6586522397c2430ae1091309667fd8337",
      "text": "特别是因为海外作品的对嘴口型不一样，必须思考\n怎么配音才能显得自然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60938a44f1a56db86e44d8a9bd2b999495b9f900c203d78acf63944a2009c0ff",
      "text": "工作定下来之后，您做了很多练习呢。\n练习的成果完全展现出来了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_02:1_5_021_02:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd51d209e171b3dc841e3b83ccd85c08f19d97cd6c48506ff494d3a24a6d1e84",
      "text": "……谢谢。借着这股劲头，\n下一份工作我也会加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
